<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Time Warner started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Time Warner started.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Furman Selz said it initiated coverage of Time Warner Inc as neutral.</p>
<p>-- set a 12-month price target of $45 a share.</p>
<p>-- said management is refocusing on new, reinvigorated strategy.</p>
<p>-- said company plans to simplify corporate structure, rationalize some cable television assets, reduce debt, cut costs and show tangible financial operating progress.</p>
</text>
